			"Message": "chore(Grove): Update Rust documentation submodule\n\nAdvance the Documentation/Rust submodule pointer from d987326e to 76eda41e (2 new commits). This pulls in the latest Rust documentation updates for the Grove crate, maintaining alignment with the ongoing linter consolidation and PascalCase naming convention enforcement across the codebase.",
